    },
    {
      "id": "e709ed37-1821-409a-a9f7-c2146c852e24",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "37d2b008-fa85-44bd-a5c4-5fa0f95b00ad",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Nib: The lodge\nboasts heated\nfloors, a private\nhorizon, and\nmature",
                "silence. The\nsilence is\nactually a broken\npump. I wrote the\nlisting",
                "before I saw the\npipe map. I would\nlike to correct\nthat before",
                "someone believes\nme."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2eaf70de-426e-41bc-aafc-79813cb444d2",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "18478b0c-2c58-417e-aaee-73f1b33b10c1",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Nib lays two pages\nside by side. The\ninvoice names one\nvalve",
                "inspection and six\nrepaired roof\npanels. The sale\nschedule names the",
                "lodge walls and\ncourtyard but\nexcludes municipal\npipes. A tempting",
                "summary says Slush\npaid for\neverything below\nthe roof. Nib\ncrosses",
                "it out. The\ninspection bill\nnames a service,\nnot a transfer of\nthe",
                "inspected object.\nHe asks for\nwording a nervous\nbuyer could safely",
                "repeat."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d216cf1b-645a-4453-afa5-49c48d76e990",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "e6d9b309-0982-45fc-a5dc-214147debec1",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The disclosure\nlists walls, roof,\nand courtyard. It\nexcludes",
                "municipal pipes\nand rights of\npassage. A\nseparate\ninspection invoice",
                "carries Slush's\nletterhead. Nib\ncircles EXCLUDES\nwith a pen",
                "expensive enough\nto regret every\ncircle."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dd3ab019-96a0-4e1a-a6bc-62d370e8a86f",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "de91a774-9383-4ff0-ac39-e5ad2904da23",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "After comparing\nthe disclosure\nwith the\ninspection\ninvoice, who",
                "retains the pipe\nnetwork?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "999e5167-689f-49d0-ad42-07e5407a6194",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "337e63eb-5f44-48d9-a02e-a525db007f85",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which statement\ncan stay on the\ncorrected listing?\nConsider what the",
                "invoice proves was\ndone and what the\nsale schedule\nactually",
                "includes. Slush\nwill receive the\nrevision too. Nib\nwants to",
                "acknowledge real\nrepairs without\nturning an\ninspected public\npipe",
                "into private\nproperty, or\npretending a paid\ninspection was\nnever",
                "useful work."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "911aac2a-720c-4a45-a56c-f1c6c6e5d65c",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "0faa24ae-c1eb-4726-a887-766174bc4ed6",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Slush: You have\ndiscovered a\ndistinction.\nCongratulations. I",
                "discovered twelve\nleaking roofs\nwhile the council\ndiscovered lunch.",
                "Bring me a\nworkable network\nplan, and I will\ndiscuss my\ninvoice.",
                "Bring me a slogan,\nand I will charge\nfor the umbrella."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
